        "native_id": "oaz154lu47dz",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "We are currently investigating reports of increased HTTP 429 (Rate Limit Exceeded) errors impacting users accessing dash.cloudflare.com. This issue primarily affects legitimate users connecting via shared egress networks (such as Cloudflare One default egress IPs or external corporate proxies). Our engineering team is actively investigating the root cause and adjusting rate-limiting thresholds to restore normal dashboard access.",
